:P.The to CCSID for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*FILE:EPK.
:PD.The value of the file.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a number of up to 5 digits. The value must be from 1 to 65533.
:EPARML.
