:PD.Carriage return and line feed.
:PT.:PK.*LF:EPK.
:PD.Line feed.
:PT.:PK.*CR:EPK.
:PD.Carriage return.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *LFCR.
:EHELP.
