:P.The format of the data&colon. fixed-length fields or delimited.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*DLM:EPK.
:PD.Delimited.
:PT.:PK.*FIXED:EPK.
:PD.Fixed length.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
