:P.The string delimiter for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 1 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *DBLQUOTE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CPYFRMIMPF/STRESCCHR'.String escape character (STRESCCHR)
:P.The string escape character for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 1 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *STRDLM.
:EHELP.
